{"name":"Xena","hex":"#847e54","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Xena","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A female given name from Ancient Greek of modern usage."]},{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["Eris (dwarf planet)"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Xena"}],"entries":[{"title":"Xena","blocks":[{"text":"Xena is a fictional character from the Xena: Warrior Princess franchise, portrayed by New Zealander actress Lucy Lawless and co-created by Robert Tapert and John Schulian. She first appeared as a villain in the 1995–1999 television series Hercules: The Legendary Journeys before joining forces with Hercules. Xena was popular with fans, so the producers decided to create a spin-off with the character in the starring role. She later appeared in the subsequent comic book of the same name, as well as the spin-off animated film The Battle for Mount Olympus, and non-canon expanded universe material, such as books and video games."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/f4/Returnofcallisto_02.jpg/330px-Returnofcallisto_02.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xena","wikidata":"Q545694"},{"title":"Xena (wrestler)","blocks":[{"text":"Xena Kacho, known by her ring name Xena, is an Australian professional wrestler. She is best known for her tenure in World Wonder Ring Stardom, where she was a former Artist of Stardom Champion."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Xena20260103.jpg/330px-Xena20260103.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xena_(wrestler)","wikidata":"Q125450095"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Rob_Tapert.JPG/500px-Rob_Tapert.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Rob_Tapert.JPG/1280px-Rob_Tapert.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Rob_Tapert.JPG/500px-Rob_Tapert.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Xena co-creator Robert Tapert","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARob_Tapert.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/0/05/Xena_Gabrielle.jpg/330px-Xena_Gabrielle.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/0/05/Xena_Gabrielle.jpg/330px-Xena_Gabrielle.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Xena with Gabrielle","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AXena_Gabrielle.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/2006-16-a-full-1-.jpg/500px-2006-16-a-full-1-.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/2006-16-a-full-1-.jpg/1280px-2006-16-a-full-1-.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/2006-16-a-full-1-.jpg/500px-2006-16-a-full-1-.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Artist's impression of Eris and Dysnomia. Eris is the main object, Dysnomia the small grey disk just above it. The flaring object top left is the Sun.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A2006-16-a-full-1-.jpg"}],"sounds":{"Xena":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-Xena.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6b/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-Xena.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-Xena.wav.mp3"},{"type":"au